2. The reference implementation, google/brotli
   https://github.com/google/brotli

   No code is copied from it. To compress as it does, oxbrotli uses the same
   numeric settings: hash multipliers, the scores and penalties that rank
   matches, the block splitter's thresholds and block sizes, the thresholds
   that choose literal context modeling, histogram tuning constants, and the
   hash table sizes per quality. The same static dictionary also ships with it.

